.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-daemon-start 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-daemon\-start \- Start the daemon in the background
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm daemon start\fR [\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the daemon in the background
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR
Try direct UDP paths between relayed peers (experimental)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
